#: ../../source/docs/modules/antenna.rst:3 fbc5449297db45088f34f8ae921b46e0
msgid "Antenna Pointing"
msgstr "天线指向"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/antenna.rst:5 f3b9a87d604a4ed39d9e8619e2bf7d43
msgid ""
"By specifying the ground station location, this module will output (via text"
" and speech) the relevant azimuth and elevation angles to point at the UAV "
"throughout its flight. This is useful for a manually pointed antenna."
msgstr "通过指定地面站位置，该模块将以文字和语音形式输出指向无人机的方位角和仰角，在整个飞行过程中持续更新。适用于手动调整指向的天线。"
